{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16106190","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16106190","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1610619001:0":{"text":"别紧张，休，只是简单的聊天而已。","source_cn":"别紧张，休，只是简单的聊天而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x915E17B47BADE806","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610619002:0":{"text":"希望你表现出色一点，不要像皮帕那样紧张过度，影响伊芙特使的工作。","source_cn":"希望你表现出色一点，不要像皮帕那样紧张过度，影响伊芙特...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7C8DB845506E0ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610619003:1":{"text":"那么开始吧。休，你为什么要报名参加宫廷魔法师选拔赛？","source_cn":"那么开始吧。休，你为什么要报名参加宫廷魔法师选拔赛？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5677477B524CF377","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610619004:1":{"text":"我确实对宫廷魔法师这个职位很感兴趣。如果我能成为宫廷魔法师，我就有望借此机会得到王室认可，复兴家族。","source_cn":"我确实对宫廷魔法师这个职位很感兴趣。如果我能成为宫廷魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD83EFBBC1AE896F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610619005:1":{"text":"家族？对了，你是……格伦沃顿家族的后裔。昨天考试的时候，你都做了什么？","source_cn":"家族？对了，你是……格伦沃顿家族的后裔。昨天考试的时候...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB7644BAB4170654","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1610619006:1":{"text":"一开始只是正常陪伴公主参观画廊。画作受损之后，我和格墨文负责寻找修复画作的材料。","source_cn":"一开始只是正常陪伴公主参观画廊。画作受损之后，我和格墨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66FFAA041880724E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1610619007:1":{"text":"只做了这件事吗？有没有什么证据？","source_cn":"只做了这件事吗？有没有什么证据？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x093D25B6619D7B5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1610619008:0":{"text":"是的，修复那幅画的材料很珍贵，也很难凑齐，我和格墨文花费了很大力气。","source_cn":"是的，修复那幅画的材料很珍贵，也很难凑齐，我和格墨文花...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11981D3F2F8FE0FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1610619009:0":{"text":"我们在找材料的时候还碰到了赫普老师、科丝蒂和<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，他们可以证明。","source_cn":"我们在找材料的时候还碰到了赫普老师、科丝蒂和<styl...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x017AE206930EB7D9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"我们在找材料的时候还碰到了赫普老师、科丝蒂和<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，他们可以证明。","female":"我们在找材料的时候还碰到了赫普老师、科丝蒂和<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，他们可以证明。","variant_male_record_index":"200725","variant_female_record_index":"200726","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1610619010:1":{"text":"嗯……我知道了。昨天之前，你最后一次见到校长是什么时候？","source_cn":"嗯……我知道了。昨天之前，你最后一次见到校长是什么时候？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B116FC677E6EB6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1610619011:1":{"text":"是选拔开始的那天。雷蒙校长宣布选拔赛初筛开始，后来王后陛下到来的时候，他也在台上。","source_cn":"是选拔开始的那天。雷蒙校长宣布选拔赛初筛开始，后来王后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7523EBC286E00F2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1610619012:1":{"text":"这之后我就一直在专心准备选拔考试，没有再见过校长了。直到昨天……","source_cn":"这之后我就一直在专心准备选拔考试，没有再见过校长了。直...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE1BFF3645BC5845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1610619013:1":{"text":"那我们聊聊昨天的事情吧，你怎么会想到要用反魔法射线装置的？你以前用过它？很熟悉它的功能？","source_cn":"那我们聊聊昨天的事情吧，你怎么会想到要用反魔法射线装置...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x259962C0B94E8869","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1610619014:1":{"text":"以前我并没有用过，也算不上熟悉。但我知道反魔法力场可以创造一片“魔力真空”，让范围内的魔法无效化。","source_cn":"以前我并没有用过，也算不上熟悉。但我知道反魔法力场可以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD11E1E505F5CE71C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1610619015:1":{"text":"当时我很着急，一直在想有什么办法能从内部破坏守卫的魔法阵，后来一下子想到了反魔法射线装置……","source_cn":"当时我很着急，一直在想有什么办法能从内部破坏守卫的魔法...","status":"matched","hash_